<title>SWEDEN: Sweden Finmin - price stability goal should be in law.</title>
<headline>Sweden Finmin - price stability goal should be in law.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish Finance Minister Erik Asbrink said on Wednesday that a government commission recommended a price stability target should be written into law.</p>
</text>
